# Tom Paris, Risk-Taker {4}{U}{R} (cast on turn 1 off two Black Lotuses, a Mox Sapphire and a Mox Ruby) is on the
# battlefield with an Ornithopter when Howling Mine makes Bot1 draw two cards in its turn-3 draw step: the second card
